    "Enabled extraction rules run after each successful HTTP response. Existing variables with the same name are replaced.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aktive Regeln werden nach jeder erfolgreichen HTTP-Antwort ausgeführt und ersetzen gleichnamige Variablen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enabled extraction rules run after each successful HTTP response. Existing variables with the same name are replaced."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las reglas activas se aplican tras cada respuesta HTTP correcta y sustituyen variables con el mismo nombre."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les règles actives s’appliquent après chaque réponse HTTP réussie et remplacent les variables de même nom."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有効なルールは HTTP の成功レスポンスごとに実行され、同名の変数を更新します。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "활성 규칙은 성공한 HTTP 응답마다 실행되며 같은 이름의 변수를 덮어씁니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As regras ativas são aplicadas após cada resposta HTTP bem-sucedida e substituem variáveis com o mesmo nome."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用的提取规则会在每次 HTTP 成功响应后执行，同名变量会被覆盖。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "啟用的擷取規則會在每次 HTTP 成功回應後執行，同名變數會被覆寫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter /timestamp, /requestId in Ignored paths to skip values that change every time. A path also skips nested fields. Arrays are compared by position. Replace the baseline only when you want a new reference.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geben Sie unter Ignorierte Pfade /timestamp, /requestId ein, um wechselnde Werte und untergeordnete Felder auszuschließen. Arrays werden nach Position verglichen. Ersetzen Sie die Referenz nur bei Bedarf."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter /timestamp, /requestId in Ignored paths to skip values that change every time. A path also skips nested fields. Arrays are compared by position. Replace the baseline only when you want a new reference."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Introduzca /timestamp, /requestId en Rutas ignoradas para omitir valores cambiantes y campos anidados. Los arrays se comparan por posición. Sustituya la referencia solo cuando necesite una nueva."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saisissez /timestamp, /requestId dans Chemins ignorés pour exclure les valeurs variables et leurs champs imbriqués. Les tableaux sont comparés par position. Remplacez la référence seulement pour en définir une nouvelle."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「無視するパス」に /timestamp, /requestId を入力すると、変動する値と配下のフィールドを除外します。配列は位置で比較します。新しい基準が必要なときだけ置き換えてください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "무시할 경로에 /timestamp, /requestId를 입력하면 매번 바뀌는 값과 하위 필드를 제외합니다. 배열은 위치별로 비교합니다. 새 기준이 필요할 때만 교체하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Insira /timestamp, /requestId em Caminhos ignorados para excluir valores que mudam e seus campos internos. Arrays são comparados por posição. Substitua a referência apenas quando precisar de uma nova."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在“忽略的路径”中填入 /timestamp, /requestId，跳过每次变化的值及其下级字段。数组按位置对比。只有需要新参考时才替换基准。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在「忽略的路徑」填入 /timestamp, /requestId，略過每次變動的值及其下層欄位。陣列依位置比較。只有需要新參考時才取代基準。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Example: /timestamp, /requestId. A path also ignores all fields below it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beispiel: /timestamp, /requestId. Untergeordnete Felder werden ebenfalls ignoriert."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Example: /timestamp, /requestId. A path also ignores all fields below it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ejemplo: /timestamp, /requestId. También se omiten los campos bajo cada ruta."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Exemple : /timestamp, /requestId. Les champs sous ces chemins sont aussi ignorés."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例：/timestamp, /requestId。指定したパスの配下もすべて除外します。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "예: /timestamp, /requestId. 경로 아래의 모든 필드도 무시됩니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Exemplo: /timestamp, /requestId. Os campos abaixo de cada caminho também são ignorados."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如 /timestamp, /requestId。指定路径也会忽略其下所有字段。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如 /timestamp, /requestId。指定路徑也會忽略其下所有欄位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
