    "Open Run Requests. Choose a folder or all HTTP requests, uncheck requests to skip, and use the arrows to put login before requests that need its token. Keep Stop on first failure enabled while setting up.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnen Sie Anfragen ausführen, wählen Sie einen Ordner oder alle HTTP-Anfragen und deaktivieren Sie übersprungene Anfragen. Verschieben Sie die Anmeldung mit den Pfeilen vor Anfragen, die ihr Token benötigen. Lassen Sie Beim ersten Fehler anhalten während der Einrichtung aktiv."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Run Requests. Choose a folder or all HTTP requests, uncheck requests to skip, and use the arrows to put login before requests that need its token. Keep Stop on first failure enabled while setting up."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abra Ejecutar solicitudes, elija una carpeta o todas las solicitudes HTTP y desmarque las que quiera omitir. Use las flechas para situar el inicio de sesión antes de las solicitudes que necesitan el token. Mantenga Detener al primer fallo al configurar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrez Exécuter les requêtes, choisissez un dossier ou toutes les requêtes HTTP et décochez celles à ignorer. Placez la connexion avant les requêtes utilisant son token avec les flèches. Gardez l’arrêt au premier échec pendant la configuration."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「リクエストを順に実行」を開き、フォルダまたは全 HTTP を選びます。不要な項目を外し、矢印でログインを token を使うリクエストより前に置きます。設定時は「最初の失敗で停止」を有効にします。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "요청 일괄 실행에서 폴더나 모든 HTTP 요청을 선택하고 건너뛸 요청을 해제하세요. 화살표로 로그인을 token이 필요한 요청 앞에 두세요. 설정 중에는 첫 실패 시 중지를 켜 두세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abra Executar requisições, escolha uma pasta ou todas as requisições HTTP e desmarque as que deseja pular. Use as setas para colocar o login antes das requisições que usam o token. Mantenha Parar na primeira falha durante a configuração."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开“批量运行”，选择文件夹或全部 HTTP 请求，取消勾选要跳过的请求，用箭头把登录放到需要 token 的请求前。配置时建议启用“首次失败时停止”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟「批次執行」，選擇資料夾或所有 HTTP 請求，取消勾選要略過的請求，用箭頭把登入放在需要 token 的請求之前。設定時建議啟用「首次失敗時停止」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open an HTTP request and tap the flowchart button in the toolbar to open HTTP Workflows.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnen Sie eine HTTP-Anfrage und klicken Sie auf das Ablaufdiagramm in der Werkzeugleiste, um HTTP-Abläufe zu öffnen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open an HTTP request and tap the flowchart button in the toolbar to open HTTP Workflows."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abra una solicitud HTTP y pulse el botón de diagrama de la barra para abrir Flujos HTTP."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrez une requête HTTP, puis utilisez le bouton de diagramme de la barre d’outils pour ouvrir Flux HTTP."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTP リクエストを開き、ツールバーのフローチャートボタンから HTTP ワークフローを開きます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTP 요청을 열고 도구 모음의 순서도 버튼을 눌러 HTTP 워크플로를 여세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abra uma requisição HTTP e use o botão de fluxograma na barra de ferramentas para abrir Fluxos HTTP."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开 HTTP 请求，点击工具栏中的流程图按钮，进入“HTTP 工作流”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟 HTTP 請求，點按工具列的流程圖按鈕，進入「HTTP 工作流程」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Replace Baseline with Current Response": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
