    "From the project sidebar add menu choose Import Spec. Select File, URL, or Paste and provide OpenAPI, Postman, or another supported format. Continue to the preview, choose a new or existing project, and inspect the generated request counts before importing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "From the project sidebar add menu choose Import Spec. Select File, URL, or Paste and provide OpenAPI, Postman, or another supported format. Continue to the preview, choose a new or existing project, and inspect the generated request counts before importing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目侧栏添加菜单选“导入规范”，在 File、URL、Paste 中选择来源，提供 OpenAPI、Postman 等受支持格式。继续到预览，选择新建或现有项目，核对生成的请求数量与目标后再导入。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "側欄新增選單選匯入規範，從檔案、URL、貼上提供 OpenAPI、Postman 等格式。預覽時選新或現有專案，確認請求數量和目標後匯入。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "追加メニューの定義読み込みで File・URL・Paste を選び、OpenAPI、Postman などを渡します。プレビューで新規または既存プロジェクトを選び、件数と宛先を確認して読み込みます。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans le menu d’ajout, importez une spécification par fichier, URL ou texte, au format OpenAPI, Postman ou autre format pris en charge. Vérifiez le projet cible et les requêtes dans l’aperçu avant confirmation."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No menu de adição, importe especificação por arquivo, URL ou texto em formato suportado, como OpenAPI ou Postman. Confira projeto novo ou existente e quantidade de requisições na prévia antes de confirmar."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Desde añadir, importe una especificación por archivo, URL o texto en formato compatible como OpenAPI o Postman. Revise proyecto nuevo o existente y cantidad de solicitudes antes de confirmar."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "추가 메뉴에서 명세 가져오기를 선택하고 파일, URL이나 붙여넣기로 OpenAPI, Postman 등 지원 형식을 제공하세요. 미리보기에서 새 프로젝트 또는 기존 프로젝트와 요청 수를 확인하세요."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Importieren Sie über das Hinzufügen-Menü per Datei, URL oder Text, etwa OpenAPI oder Postman. Prüfen Sie in der Vorschau neues oder bestehendes Zielprojekt und Anfrageanzahl vor dem Import."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Expand Advanced to choose folder strategy, request naming, preferred body type, and whether to generate example values, optional parameters, auth scaffolding, and server environments. Decide whether to link the source. HAR credentials can become placeholders; fill these values locally after import.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Expand Advanced to choose folder strategy, request naming, preferred body type, and whether to generate example values, optional parameters, auth scaffolding, and server environments. Decide whether to link the source. HAR credentials can become placeholders; fill these values locally after import."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "展开 Advanced，配置文件夹策略、请求命名、优先正文类型，以及是否生成示例值、启用可选参数、创建认证结构和服务器环境。决定是否关联来源。HAR 凭据可转换为占位变量，导入后需在本地补齐。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "展開進階設定，選資料夾、命名、本文類型、示例值、可選參數、認證結構和環境，決定是否連結來源。HAR 憑證可轉佔位變數，匯入後本機補齊。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Advanced でフォルダ、命名、本文、例の生成、任意パラメータ、認証、環境、ソース連携を設定します。HAR の資格情報は変数の仮値にでき、読み込み後にローカルで補います。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans Advanced, choisissez dossiers, noms, corps, exemples, paramètres facultatifs, structure d’authentification et environnements. Décidez du lien à la source. Les identifiants HAR peuvent devenir des variables à renseigner localement."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Em Advanced, escolha pastas, nomes, corpo, exemplos, parâmetros opcionais, estrutura de autenticação e ambientes. Defina o vínculo à fonte. Credenciais HAR podem virar variáveis a preencher localmente."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En Advanced, elija carpetas, nombres, cuerpo, ejemplos, parámetros opcionales, estructura de autenticación y entornos. Decida el vínculo al origen. Credenciales HAR pueden convertirse en variables para completar localmente."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "고급 설정에서 폴더, 이름, 본문 형식, 예시값, 선택 매개변수, 인증 구조와 환경을 정하고 원본 연결 여부를 선택하세요. HAR 자격 증명은 로컬에서 채울 변수로 바꿀 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wählen Sie unter Advanced Ordner, Namen, Texttyp, Beispiele, optionale Parameter, Authentifizierungsstruktur und Umgebungen. Entscheiden Sie über die Quellverknüpfung. HAR-Zugangsdaten können lokal auszufüllende Variablen werden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Linked Specifications and Git Access": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Linked Specifications and Git Access"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关联规范更新与 Git 访问"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "連結規範更新與 Git 存取"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "連携定義の更新と Git アクセス"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mise à jour des sources et accès Git"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Atualizar fontes e acesso Git"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Actualizar fuentes y acceso Git"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "연결 명세 업데이트와 Git 접근"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verknüpfte Definitionen und Git-Zugriff"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the linked-spec icon in the request-list toolbar and choose Check for updates. Review added, changed, and removed operations before applying the selected changes. Background spec check only notifies; it never applies changes automatically. A one-time file import has no live source to refresh.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open the linked-spec icon in the request-list toolbar and choose Check for updates. Review added, changed, and removed operations before applying the selected changes. Background spec check only notifies; it never applies changes automatically. A one-time file import has no live source to refresh."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请求列表工具栏点击关联规范图标，选择“检查更新”，审阅新增、修改、移除的操作后再应用所选项。后台规范检查仅通知，不自动应用变更。一次性文件导入没有实时来源，需要重新导入才能更新。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點工具欄規範圖示檢查更新，審閱新增、變更、移除後再套用。背景檢查只通知不自動套用；一次性檔案匯入需重新匯入更新。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "定義アイコンから更新確認し、追加・変更・削除を確認して選択適用します。バックグラウンド確認は通知だけで自動適用しません。一回限りのファイル読み込みは再読み込みが必要です。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vérifiez les mises à jour via l’icône de source liée. Examinez ajouts, modifications et suppressions avant application. La vérification en arrière-plan ne fait que notifier. Une importation ponctuelle nécessite une nouvelle importation."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verifique atualizações pelo ícone da fonte vinculada. Revise inclusões, mudanças e remoções antes de aplicar. A verificação em segundo plano apenas notifica. Uma importação única precisa ser refeita."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compruebe actualizaciones en el icono del origen vinculado. Revise adiciones, cambios y eliminaciones antes de aplicar. La revisión en segundo plano solo notifica. Una importación puntual debe repetirse."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "연결 명세 아이콘에서 업데이트를 확인하고 추가, 변경과 삭제를 검토한 뒤 적용하세요. 백그라운드 확인은 알림만 하며 자동 적용하지 않습니다. 일회성 파일은 다시 가져와야 합니다."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prüfen Sie Updates über das Symbol der verknüpften Definition. Prüfen Sie Hinzufügungen, Änderungen und Löschungen vor dem Anwenden. Hintergrundprüfung meldet nur. Ein einmaliger Dateiimport muss erneut importiert werden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For private Git sources, configure the host, organization/user, and provider token in Settings. GitHub device login is available there. Add enterprise or self-hosted hosts to Trusted Git Hosts only when they are your intended source. Provider tokens are stored in Keychain; they are separate from API request authentication.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For private Git sources, configure the host, organization/user, and provider token in Settings. GitHub device login is available there. Add enterprise or self-hosted hosts to Trusted Git Hosts only when they are your intended source. Provider tokens are stored in Keychain; they are separate from API request authentication."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私有 Git 来源在设置填写主机、组织或用户，并配置提供者令牌，也可使用 GitHub 设备登录。企业或自建 Git 主机需添加到“受信任的 Git 主机”，仅信任你确实要访问的来源。令牌存于 Keychain，与 API 请求认证分开。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私人 Git 在設定填主機、組織或使用者及令牌，也可用 GitHub 裝置登入。企業、自建主機僅按實際來源加入信任清單。令牌在 Keychain，與 API 認證分開。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "非公開 Git は設定でホスト、組織/ユーザー、トークンまたは GitHub デバイスログインを設定します。社内・自営ホストは必要なものだけ信頼します。Keychain のプロバイダートークンは API 認証とは別です。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configurez hôte, organisation/utilisateur et jeton dans les réglages pour Git privé, ou utilisez la connexion GitHub. N’autorisez que les hôtes d’entreprise voulus. Les jetons Keychain sont distincts de l’authentification API."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configure host, organização/usuário e token para Git privado nas configurações ou use login GitHub. Confie apenas nos hosts empresariais pretendidos. Tokens no Keychain são separados da autenticação API."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configure host, organización/usuario y token para Git privado en ajustes o use acceso GitHub. Confíe solo en los hosts empresariales previstos. Los tokens en Keychain son distintos de la autenticación API."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "비공개 Git은 설정에서 호스트, 조직/사용자와 토큰 또는 GitHub 로그인을 설정하세요. 필요한 기업/자체 호스트만 신뢰 목록에 넣으세요. Keychain 토큰은 API 인증과 별개입니다."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Konfigurieren Sie Host, Organisation/Benutzer und Token für privates Git oder nutzen Sie GitHub-Anmeldung. Vertrauen Sie nur vorgesehenen Unternehmenshosts. Keychain-Provider-Token sind von der API-Authentifizierung getrennt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Advanced Authentication": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Advanced Authentication"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高级认证"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "進階認證"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高度な認証"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Authentification avancée"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autenticação avançada"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autenticación avanzada"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "고급 인증"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erweiterte Authentifizierung"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose JWT Bearer, AWS Signature, Hawk, or Akamai EdgeGrid to match the server. Fill the credentials and signing fields supplied by its API documentation. Inspect the prepared request before sending. Signatures are regenerated when sending.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose JWT Bearer, AWS Signature, Hawk, or Akamai EdgeGrid to match the server. Fill the credentials and signing fields supplied by its API documentation. Inspect the prepared request before sending. Signatures are regenerated when sending."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按服务端要求选择 JWT Bearer、AWS Signature、Hawk 或 Akamai EdgeGrid，填写接口文档要求的凭据和签名字段。先检查请求预览，再发送。发送时会重新生成签名。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "依伺服器要求選 JWT Bearer、AWS Signature、Hawk 或 Akamai EdgeGrid，填寫文件要求的憑證與簽章欄位。先預覽再傳送，傳送時重新簽章。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "サーバーに合わせて JWT Bearer、AWS Signature、Hawk、Akamai EdgeGrid を選び、API 文書の認証情報を入力します。送信前にプレビューを確認します。署名は送信時に再生成されます。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choisissez JWT Bearer, AWS Signature, Hawk ou Akamai EdgeGrid selon le serveur. Renseignez les champs de sa documentation et vérifiez l’aperçu. La signature est recalculée à l’envoi."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Escolha JWT Bearer, AWS Signature, Hawk ou Akamai EdgeGrid conforme o servidor. Preencha os campos da documentação e confira a prévia. A assinatura é recalculada ao enviar."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elija JWT Bearer, AWS Signature, Hawk o Akamai EdgeGrid según el servidor. Complete los campos de su documentación y revise la vista previa. La firma se recalcula al enviar."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "서버에 맞는 JWT Bearer, AWS Signature, Hawk 또는 Akamai EdgeGrid를 선택하고 API 문서의 인증 필드를 입력하세요. 미리보기를 확인하세요. 전송 시 서명을 다시 생성합니다."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wählen Sie JWT Bearer, AWS Signature, Hawk oder Akamai EdgeGrid passend zum Server. Füllen Sie die dokumentierten Felder aus und prüfen Sie die Vorschau. Beim Senden wird neu signiert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OAuth 2.0 currently requires an access token obtained separately. Enter it manually; configuring authorization and token URLs does not perform automatic login. Digest, OAuth 1.0, and NTLM are marked as coming soon and cannot be used yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OAuth 2.0 currently requires an access token obtained separately. Enter it manually; configuring authorization and token URLs does not perform automatic login. Digest, OAuth 1.0, and NTLM are marked as coming soon and cannot be used yet."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OAuth 2.0 目前需要在外部取得访问令牌，再手动填写。仅配置授权地址和令牌地址不会自动登录。Digest、OAuth 1.0、NTLM 标注为尚未提供，目前不能使用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OAuth 2.0 目前須在外部取得存取令牌並手動填入。設定授權與令牌網址不會自動登入。Digest、OAuth 1.0、NTLM 尚未提供。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OAuth 2.0 のアクセストークンは別途取得し手入力します。URL 設定だけでは自動ログインしません。Digest、OAuth 1.0、NTLM は未提供です。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OAuth 2.0 exige un jeton obtenu ailleurs et saisi manuellement. Les URL ne lancent pas de connexion automatique. Digest, OAuth 1.0 et NTLM ne sont pas encore disponibles."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OAuth 2.0 exige token obtido separadamente e inserido manualmente. As URLs não fazem login automático. Digest, OAuth 1.0 e NTLM ainda não estão disponíveis."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OAuth 2.0 requiere un token obtenido aparte e introducido manualmente. Las URL no inician sesión automáticamente. Digest, OAuth 1.0 y NTLM aún no están disponibles."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OAuth 2.0 토큰은 별도로 발급받아 직접 입력해야 합니다. URL 설정만으로 로그인하지 않습니다. Digest, OAuth 1.0, NTLM은 아직 제공되지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OAuth 2.0 benötigt ein separat bezogenes, manuell eingegebenes Token. URLs lösen keine automatische Anmeldung aus. Digest, OAuth 1.0 und NTLM sind noch nicht verfügbar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTP Network Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTP Network Settings"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
