    },
    "Open the selected HTTP request’s Settings. Choose automatic HTTP version or HTTP/1 or HTTP/2, set its timeout, and configure redirect limits. Keep certificate verification enabled for normal use. A longer timeout does not fix an invalid host or port.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open the selected HTTP request’s Settings. Choose automatic HTTP version or HTTP/1 or HTTP/2, set its timeout, and configure redirect limits. Keep certificate verification enabled for normal use. A longer timeout does not fix an invalid host or port."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开当前 HTTP 请求的设置，选择自动协议版本、HTTP/1 或 HTTP/2，设置超时及重定向次数。正常使用应开启证书验证。延长超时不能修复错误的主机或端口。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟目前 HTTP 請求設定，選自動版本、HTTP/1 或 HTTP/2，設定逾時與重新導向上限。一般使用保留憑證驗證。延長逾時無法修正主機或連接埠。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTP リクエストの設定でバージョン、タイムアウト、リダイレクト上限を設定します。通常は証明書検証を有効にします。待機時間を延ばしてもホストやポートの誤りは直りません。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans les réglages de la requête HTTP, choisissez version, délai et limite de redirections. Gardez la vérification des certificats. Allonger le délai ne corrige pas un hôte ou port erroné."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nas configurações da requisição HTTP, escolha versão, tempo limite e limite de redirecionamentos. Mantenha a verificação de certificados. Aumentar o tempo não corrige host ou porta incorretos."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En ajustes de la solicitud HTTP, elija versión, tiempo de espera y límite de redirecciones. Mantenga la verificación de certificados. Más tiempo no corrige un host o puerto incorrecto."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTP 요청 설정에서 버전, 시간 제한과 리디렉션 한도를 설정하세요. 일반적으로 인증서 검증을 켜두세요. 시간을 늘려도 잘못된 호스트나 포트는 해결되지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wählen Sie in den HTTP-Anfrageeinstellungen Version, Zeitlimit und Umleitungsgrenze. Lassen Sie Zertifikatsprüfung aktiviert. Mehr Zeit behebt keinen falschen Host oder Port."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review redirect options for preserving the original method, forwarding Authorization to another host, and Referer handling. Enable URL encoding when needed and disable the cookie jar only for requests that must not reuse login cookies. Inspect the final URL and headers before testing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Review redirect options for preserving the original method, forwarding Authorization to another host, and Referer handling. Enable URL encoding when needed and disable the cookie jar only for requests that must not reuse login cookies. Inspect the final URL and headers before testing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查重定向是否保留原方法、是否向其他主机转发 Authorization，以及 Referer 处理方式。按需要开启 URL 编码；仅在请求不应复用登录 Cookie 时禁用 Cookie 存储。测试前检查解析后的 URL 和请求头。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "檢查重新導向方法、跨主機 Authorization 與 Referer。按需啟用 URL 編碼；僅在不應沿用登入 Cookie 時停用 Cookie 儲存。測試前檢查 URL 與標頭。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "リダイレクト時のメソッド維持、別ホストへの Authorization 転送、Referer を確認します。必要な URL エンコードと Cookie 設定を選び、送信前に URL とヘッダーを確認します。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vérifiez méthode, transfert d’Authorization vers un autre hôte et Referer lors des redirections. Réglez encodage URL et cookies selon le besoin, puis vérifiez URL et en-têtes."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Confira método, envio de Authorization a outro host e Referer nos redirecionamentos. Ajuste codificação URL e cookies conforme necessário e revise URL e cabeçalhos."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Revise método, envío de Authorization a otro host y Referer en redirecciones. Configure codificación URL y cookies según corresponda y revise URL y cabeceras."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "리디렉션의 메서드 유지, 다른 호스트로 Authorization 전달 및 Referer를 확인하세요. 필요에 따라 URL 인코딩과 Cookie를 설정하고 URL과 헤더를 검토하세요."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prüfen Sie Methode, Authorization-Weitergabe an andere Hosts und Referer bei Umleitungen. Stellen Sie URL-Kodierung und Cookies passend ein und prüfen Sie URL und Header."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App Defaults and iCloud": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App Defaults and iCloud"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用默认值与 iCloud"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "應用程式預設值與 iCloud"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アプリの既定値と iCloud"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Valeurs par défaut et iCloud"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Padrões do app e iCloud"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Valores predeterminados e iCloud"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "앱 기본값과 iCloud"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App-Standardwerte und iCloud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Settings, configure HTTP defaults, editor indentation, response filtering, and history limits. Review each existing request’s own settings separately. iCloud needs an eligible signed app and an Apple account; local ad hoc builds may disable CloudKit. Sync does not keep live socket connections running.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Settings, configure HTTP defaults, editor indentation, response filtering, and history limits. Review each existing request’s own settings separately. iCloud needs an eligible signed app and an Apple account; local ad hoc builds may disable CloudKit. Sync does not keep live socket connections running."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在设置中配置 HTTP 默认值、编辑器缩进、响应过滤及历史记录上限；已有请求的独立设置需逐个检查。iCloud 需要具备相应签名权限的应用和 Apple 账户，本地临时签名构建可能停用 CloudKit。同步不会保持实时连接运行。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "設定中調整 HTTP 預設值、縮排、回應篩選與歷史上限；既有請求設定須另行檢查。iCloud 需要合適簽章與 Apple 帳號，臨時簽章版可能停用 CloudKit。同步不會維持即時連線。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "設定で HTTP 既定値、字下げ、応答フィルター、履歴上限を設定します。既存リクエストは個別確認します。iCloud には適切な署名と Apple アカウントが必要です。臨時署名版では CloudKit が無効な場合があります。接続は同期されません。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réglez valeurs HTTP, indentation, filtres et historique dans les réglages. Vérifiez les requêtes existantes séparément. iCloud exige une signature adaptée et un compte Apple ; une version ad hoc peut désactiver CloudKit. Les connexions actives ne sont pas maintenues par la synchronisation."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configure padrões HTTP, indentação, filtros e histórico nos ajustes. Confira requisições existentes separadamente. iCloud exige assinatura adequada e conta Apple; builds ad hoc podem desativar CloudKit. A sincronização não mantém conexões ativas."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configure valores HTTP, sangría, filtros e historial en ajustes. Revise solicitudes existentes por separado. iCloud exige firma adecuada y cuenta Apple; compilaciones ad hoc pueden desactivar CloudKit. La sincronización no mantiene conexiones activas."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "설정에서 HTTP 기본값, 들여쓰기, 응답 필터와 기록 한도를 조정하세요. 기존 요청은 따로 확인하세요. iCloud에는 적절한 서명과 Apple 계정이 필요하며 임시 서명 빌드는 CloudKit을 끌 수 있습니다. 동기화는 실시간 연결을 유지하지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Konfigurieren Sie HTTP-Standardwerte, Einrückung, Filter und Verlauf in Einstellungen. Prüfen Sie bestehende Anfragen separat. iCloud braucht passende Signierung und Apple-Konto; Ad-hoc-Builds können CloudKit deaktivieren. Synchronisierung hält keine Verbindungen offen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shortcuts and MCP": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shortcuts and MCP"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快捷指令与 MCP"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "捷徑與 MCP"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ショートカットと MCP"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Raccourcis et MCP"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Atalhos e MCP"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Atajos y MCP"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "단축어와 MCP"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kurzbefehle und MCP"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Apple Shortcuts, find Reqeast’s actions for HTTP, TCP, UDP, WebSocket, SSE, and gRPC. Configure the action’s fields, run a small test, and inspect its output before adding it to a larger automation. These actions are separate from saved HTTP workflows.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Apple Shortcuts, find Reqeast’s actions for HTTP, TCP, UDP, WebSocket, SSE, and gRPC. Configure the action’s fields, run a small test, and inspect its output before adding it to a larger automation. These actions are separate from saved HTTP workflows."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Apple 快捷指令中查找 Reqeast 的 HTTP、TCP、UDP、WebSocket、SSE、gRPC 操作，填写该操作的参数，先小范围运行并检查输出，再加入更大的自动化。它们与应用内保存的 HTTP 工作流是不同的入口。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 捷徑中選 Reqeast 的六種協定動作，填參數、先測試並檢查輸出，再加入自動化。這與已儲存 HTTP 工作流程是不同入口。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple ショートカットで Reqeast の各プロトコルのアクションを選び、項目を設定して小さなテストで出力を確認します。保存済み HTTP ワークフローとは別の機能です。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans Raccourcis Apple, choisissez une action Reqeast pour chaque protocole. Configurez les champs et testez sa sortie avant une automatisation plus large. Ces actions sont distinctes des workflows HTTP enregistrés."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nos Atalhos Apple, escolha ações Reqeast para cada protocolo. Preencha os campos e teste a saída antes de ampliar a automação. São diferentes dos fluxos HTTP salvos."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En Atajos Apple, elija acciones Reqeast por protocolo. Complete campos y pruebe la salida antes de ampliar la automatización. Son distintas de los flujos HTTP guardados."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 단축어에서 Reqeast의 프로토콜별 동작을 선택하고 필드를 입력하세요. 작은 테스트로 출력을 확인한 뒤 자동화에 추가하세요. 저장된 HTTP 워크플로와 별개입니다."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wählen Sie Reqeast-Protokollaktionen in Apple Kurzbefehle, konfigurieren Sie Felder und testen Sie die Ausgabe vor größerer Automatisierung. Sie sind von gespeicherten HTTP-Workflows getrennt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On macOS, enable MCP export in Settings and follow its Setup Guide to configure your client. MCP reads exported request and response data. Review bodies and custom fields for private content: an AI client may send what it reads to its provider. Disable export when no longer needed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On macOS, enable MCP export in Settings and follow its Setup Guide to configure your client. MCP reads exported request and response data. Review bodies and custom fields for private content: an AI client may send what it reads to its provider. Disable export when no longer needed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 在设置中启用 MCP 导出，按“设置指南”提供的配置接入客户端。MCP 读取导出的请求和响应数据。接入前检查正文和自定义字段中的私人内容：AI 客户端可能把读取的数据发送给其服务提供者。不再使用时关闭导出。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 設定啟用 MCP 匯出並按指南配置用戶端。MCP 讀取匯出的請求、回應。先檢查正文和自訂欄位：AI 用戶端可能傳送資料至其服務商。不用時關閉。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS の設定で MCP エクスポートを有効にし、設定ガイドでクライアントを構成します。本文や独自項目を確認してください。AI クライアントが取得データをサービス提供者へ送る場合があります。不要時は無効にします。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sur macOS, activez l’export MCP et suivez le guide pour le client. MCP lit les requêtes et réponses exportées. Vérifiez les données privées dans les corps : le client IA peut les transmettre à son fournisseur. Désactivez l’export après usage."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No macOS, ative exportação MCP e siga o guia do cliente. MCP lê requisições e respostas exportadas. Revise conteúdo privado nos corpos: o cliente IA pode enviá-lo ao provedor. Desative quando não precisar."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En macOS, active exportación MCP y siga la guía del cliente. MCP lee solicitudes y respuestas exportadas. Revise contenido privado: el cliente IA puede enviarlo a su proveedor. Desactive cuando no lo necesite."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 설정에서 MCP 내보내기를 켜고 설정 안내로 클라이언트를 구성하세요. MCP는 내보낸 요청과 응답을 읽습니다. 본문의 개인정보를 확인하세요. AI 클라이언트가 공급자에 데이터를 보낼 수 있습니다. 필요 없으면 끄세요."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aktivieren Sie MCP-Export unter macOS und konfigurieren Sie den Client mit der Anleitung. MCP liest exportierte Anfragen und Antworten. Prüfen Sie private Inhalte: KI-Clients können Daten an ihren Anbieter senden. Deaktivieren Sie den Export nach Bedarf."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diagnosing Failed Requests": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diagnosing Failed Requests"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请求失败排查"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請求失敗排查"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "リクエスト失敗の診断"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diagnostiquer les échecs"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diagnosticar falhas"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diagnosticar errores"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "요청 실패 진단"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fehlgeschlagene Anfragen prüfen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start with the prepared URL, active environment, and missing variables. For 401 or 403, check credentials and permissions; for 400 or 415, check body shape and Content-Type. For connection or TLS errors, check host, port, protocol, and the certificate. Read the complete error before changing settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start with the prepared URL, active environment, and missing variables. For 401 or 403, check credentials and permissions; for 400 or 415, check body shape and Content-Type. For connection or TLS errors, check host, port, protocol, and the certificate. Read the complete error before changing settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先检查请求预览中的实际 URL、当前环境和缺失变量。401、403 检查凭据及权限；400、415 检查正文结构和 Content-Type。连接或 TLS 错误检查主机、端口、协议及证书。先阅读完整错误，再修改设置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先看預覽 URL、環境與缺少變數。401/403 查憑證權限；400/415 查正文與 Content-Type。連線或 TLS 查主機、埠、協定與憑證。先讀完整錯誤再調整。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "まず URL、環境、未定義変数を確認します。401/403 は認証と権限、400/415 は本文と Content-Type、接続/TLS はホスト、ポート、証明書を確認します。設定変更前にエラー全文を読みます。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vérifiez URL, environnement et variables manquantes. Pour 401/403, vérifiez accès ; pour 400/415, corps et Content-Type ; pour connexion/TLS, hôte, port et certificat. Lisez toute l’erreur avant de modifier les réglages."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Confira URL, ambiente e variáveis ausentes. Para 401/403, acesso; 400/415, corpo e Content-Type; conexão/TLS, host, porta e certificado. Leia o erro completo antes de alterar configurações."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Revise URL, entorno y variables ausentes. Para 401/403, acceso; 400/415, cuerpo y Content-Type; conexión/TLS, host, puerto y certificado. Lea todo el error antes de cambiar ajustes."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "URL, 환경과 누락 변수를 먼저 확인하세요. 401/403은 인증과 권한, 400/415는 본문과 Content-Type, 연결/TLS는 호스트, 포트와 인증서를 확인하세요. 설정 변경 전 오류 전체를 읽으세요."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prüfen Sie URL, Umgebung und fehlende Variablen. 401/403: Zugang und Rechte; 400/415: Body und Content-Type; Verbindung/TLS: Host, Port und Zertifikat. Lesen Sie den gesamten Fehler vor Änderungen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run a failing workflow request individually first, then check its position, extraction path, and expected response. Data rows are isolated, so a previous row cannot supply the next row’s variables. Before resetting app data, export a backup and record the failing request’s error.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Run a failing workflow request individually first, then check its position, extraction path, and expected response. Data rows are isolated, so a previous row cannot supply the next row’s variables. Before resetting app data, export a backup and record the failing request’s error."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作流失败时先单独发送失败的请求，再检查顺序、提取路径及预期响应。数据行彼此隔离，上一行不能为下一行提供变量。重置应用数据前应导出备份，并记录失败请求的完整错误。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作流程失敗先單獨測請求，再查順序、提取路徑與預期回應。資料列隔離，不能跨列取變數。重設資料前匯出備份並記錄完整錯誤。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "失敗したリクエストを単独実行し、順番、抽出パス、応答を確認します。データ行間で変数は共有されません。データ初期化前にバックアップとエラーを保存します。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Testez d’abord la requête seule, puis ordre, extraction et réponse attendue. Les lignes ne partagent pas leurs variables. Exportez une sauvegarde et conservez l’erreur avant toute réinitialisation."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Teste a requisição isolada, depois ordem, extração e resposta esperada. Linhas não compartilham variáveis. Exporte backup e registre o erro antes de redefinir dados."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pruebe la solicitud sola y luego orden, extracción y respuesta esperada. Las filas no comparten variables. Exporte copia y guarde el error antes de restablecer datos."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "실패 요청을 단독 실행하고 순서, 추출 경로와 예상 응답을 확인하세요. 행 간 변수는 공유되지 않습니다. 데이터 초기화 전에 백업과 오류를 저장하세요."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Testen Sie die Anfrage einzeln, dann Reihenfolge, Extraktion und erwartete Antwort. Datenzeilen teilen keine Variablen. Sichern Sie Daten und Fehlermeldung vor dem Zurücksetzen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
