    "This file was created with a newer version of RHEQ. Some data may not import correctly.": {
      "comment": "A warning label that appears when a user imports a project that was created with a newer version of Reqeast. The warning indicates that some features or data might not be imported correctly.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Datei wurde mit einer neueren Version von RHEQ erstellt. Einige Daten werden möglicherweise nicht korrekt importiert."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este archivo fue creado con una versión más reciente de RHEQ. Algunos datos podrían no importarse correctamente."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce fichier a été créé avec une version plus récente de RHEQ. Certaines données pourraient ne pas s'importer correctement."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このファイルは新しいバージョンの RHEQ で作成されました。一部のデータが正しくインポートされない場合があります。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 파일은 최신 버전의 RHEQ로 생성되었습니다. 일부 데이터가 올바르게 가져오지 못할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este arquivo foi criado com uma versão mais recente do RHEQ. Alguns dados podem não ser importados corretamente."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此文件由较新版本的 RHEQ 创建。部分数据可能无法正确导入。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此檔案由較新版本的 RHEQ 建立。部分資料可能無法正確匯入。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This file was created with a newer version of RHEQ. Some data may not import correctly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install the stable Rust toolchain, open a terminal at the RHEQ repository root, and build the release executable. The executable is rust/target/release/reqeast-cli. You can copy it into your preferred tools directory.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Install the stable Rust toolchain, open a terminal at the RHEQ repository root, and build the release executable. The executable is rust/target/release/reqeast-cli. You can copy it into your preferred tools directory."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装稳定版 Rust，在 RHEQ 仓库根目录打开终端，构建 release 可执行文件。输出为 rust/target/release/reqeast-cli，可复制到常用工具目录。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安裝穩定版 Rust，在 RHEQ 根目錄開終端機建置 release。輸出為 rust/target/release/reqeast-cli，可複製到工具目錄。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安定版 Rust を用意し、リポジトリのルートで release ビルドします。rust/target/release/reqeast-cli が生成され、任意のツール用フォルダへコピーできます。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installez Rust stable et compilez en release depuis la racine du dépôt. Le binaire rust/target/release/reqeast-cli peut être copié dans votre dossier d’outils."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instale Rust estável e compile release na raiz do repositório. Copie rust/target/release/reqeast-cli para sua pasta de ferramentas se desejar."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instale Rust estable y compile release desde la raíz del repositorio. Puede copiar rust/target/release/reqeast-cli a su carpeta de herramientas."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "안정 버전 Rust를 설치하고 저장소 루트에서 release 빌드하세요. rust/target/release/reqeast-cli 실행 파일을 원하는 도구 폴더로 복사할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stabiles Rust installieren und im Repository-Root release bauen. Die Datei rust/target/release/reqeast-cli kann in Ihren Werkzeugordner kopiert werden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Apple Shortcuts, find RHEQ’s actions for HTTP, TCP, UDP, WebSocket, SSE, and gRPC. Configure the action’s fields, run a small test, and inspect its output before adding it to a larger automation. These actions are separate from saved HTTP workflows.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Apple Shortcuts, find RHEQ’s actions for HTTP, TCP, UDP, WebSocket, SSE, and gRPC. Configure the action’s fields, run a small test, and inspect its output before adding it to a larger automation. These actions are separate from saved HTTP workflows."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Apple 快捷指令中查找 RHEQ 的 HTTP、TCP、UDP、WebSocket、SSE、gRPC 操作，填写该操作的参数，先小范围运行并检查输出，再加入更大的自动化。它们与应用内保存的 HTTP 工作流是不同的入口。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 捷徑中選 RHEQ 的六種協定動作，填參數、先測試並檢查輸出，再加入自動化。這與已儲存 HTTP 工作流程是不同入口。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple ショートカットで RHEQ の各プロトコルのアクションを選び、項目を設定して小さなテストで出力を確認します。保存済み HTTP ワークフローとは別の機能です。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans Raccourcis Apple, choisissez une action RHEQ pour chaque protocole. Configurez les champs et testez sa sortie avant une automatisation plus large. Ces actions sont distinctes des workflows HTTP enregistrés."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nos Atalhos Apple, escolha ações RHEQ para cada protocolo. Preencha os campos e teste a saída antes de ampliar a automação. São diferentes dos fluxos HTTP salvos."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En Atajos Apple, elija acciones RHEQ por protocolo. Complete campos y pruebe la salida antes de ampliar la automatización. Son distintas de los flujos HTTP guardados."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 단축어에서 RHEQ의 프로토콜별 동작을 선택하고 필드를 입력하세요. 작은 테스트로 출력을 확인한 뒤 자동화에 추가하세요. 저장된 HTTP 워크플로와 별개입니다."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wählen Sie RHEQ-Protokollaktionen in Apple Kurzbefehle, konfigurieren Sie Felder und testen Sie die Ausgabe vor größerer Automatisierung. Sie sind von gespeicherten HTTP-Workflows getrennt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
