    "Matching interfaces are refreshed. Your credentials, test values, and workflow links are preserved. Missing interfaces are retained.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Matching interfaces are refreshed. Your credentials, test values, and workflow links are preserved. Missing interfaces are retained."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "匹配的接口会更新。认证信息、测试值和工作流引用会保留。代码中消失的接口不会删除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "符合的介面會更新。認證資訊、測試值及工作流程參照會保留。程式碼中消失的介面不會刪除。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一致するインターフェースを更新します。認証情報、テスト値、ワークフローの参照は保持されます。見つからないインターフェースも残ります。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les interfaces correspondantes sont actualisées. Les identifiants, valeurs de test et références des workflows sont conservés, ainsi que les interfaces absentes."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As interfaces correspondentes são atualizadas. Credenciais, valores de teste e referências dos fluxos são preservados. Interfaces ausentes são mantidas."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se actualizan las interfaces coincidentes. Se conservan las credenciales, los valores de prueba y las referencias de los flujos. Las interfaces ausentes se mantienen."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "일치하는 인터페이스를 갱신합니다. 인증 정보, 테스트 값, 워크플로 참조를 유지합니다. 코드에서 사라진 인터페이스도 보존합니다."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passende Schnittstellen werden aktualisiert. Zugangsdaten, Testwerte und Workflow-Verweise bleiben erhalten. Fehlende Schnittstellen werden beibehalten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
